==In animation==
[[File:Fisherman anime.png|thumb|250px|A fisherman in {{aniseries|DP}}]]
[[Marie's grandfather]] from ''[[EP162|Type Casting]]'' is a fisherman.

Several fishermen competed in the [[Seaking Catching Day]] competition in ''[[EP168|Hook, Line, and Stinker]]''

Several fishermen competed in the [[Whirl Cup]] in ''[[EP215|Octillery The Outcast]]'' and ''[[EP216|Dueling Heroes]]'', notably {{OBP|Christopher|EP216}} and {{OBP|Harrison|EP216}}.

[[Wings Alexander]] disguised himself as a fisherman in ''[[EP223|Throwing in the Noctowl]]''.

A self-proclaimed "fishing god" named [[Sullivan]] appeared in ''[[AG075|Whiscash and Ash]]'', where he was hunting for a {{pkmn2|giant}} {{p|Whiscash}} [[nickname]]d [[Nero]].

An old fisherman [[trade]]d his {{p|Charmeleon}} for the {{Shiny|golden}} {{p|Magikarp}} that {{OBP|Jimmy|AG092}} accidentally caught in a flashback in ''[[AG092|Judgment Day!]]''.

A fisherman used a {{p|Zigzagoon}} to battle a {{AP|Buizel}} in ''[[DP034|Buizel Your Way Out Of This!]]'', but lost.

An old fisherman appeared in ''[[DP098|If the Scarf Fits, ''Wear'' It!]]''.

A fisherman appeared in ''[[HZ078|Entei's Fierce Battle Cry!]]''.

