===Pokémon Adventures===
===={{MangaArc|Gold, Silver & Crystal}}====
{{main|Wilton}}
[[Wilton]], {{adv|Yellow}}'s uncle, is a Fisherman. He taught her how to fish and gave her a {{p|Doduo}} for transportation.

===={{MangaArc|HeartGold & SoulSilver}}====
A Fisherman was one of many visiting the {{safari|Johto}} in ''[[PS446|Weavile Wobbles But It Won't Fall Down]]''.

===={{MangaArc|Omega Ruby & Alpha Sapphire}}====
In ''[[PS601|Beedrill Prepares]]'', it was revealed that after the defeat of [[Team Aqua]], ex-{{tc|Aqua Admin}} {{adv|Amber}} became a Fisherman.

===={{MangaArc|Platinum}}====
A Fisherman appeared as a background character in ''[[PS418|Deprogramming Porygon-Z]]'', where he was part of a group of people who entered the {{gdis|Battle Frontier|IV}} after [[Palmer]] had his assistants open the gates.

===={{MangaArc|Black & White}}====
A Fisherman was seen in a commercial for the [[Xtransceiver]] in ''[[PS465|Lights, Camera...Action!]]''.

===={{MangaArc|X & Y}}====
A Fisherman appeared walking by the fountain in [[Santalune City]] in ''[[PS554|Kangaskhan...Kangascan't]]''.

